note Translated from Go src/sync/once.go, Once.Do (BSD 3-Clause).
note Go's Once runs a function value once across goroutines. Scribe has no function
note types (spec 4.3) and no shared mutable state (spec 7.4) yet, so this is the
note closest single-task form: a typestate that makes "run at most once" a compile
note error instead of a run-time check. The concurrent version needs 7.4.
type Once
    states Pending, Done

interface Action
    function run(action: editable Self)

function do_once(once: consumed Pending Once, action: editable Action) -> Done Once
    run(action)
    return mark_done(once)
